--- text ---
A small paragraph
with some simple
line breaks

Some text with an inline link https://flo.znkr.io/diff.

Here's a *strong text with _emphasis_ inside*.

Emphasis can be tricky if _(parenthesis)_ are involved. _(_foo_)_ only empathies the parentheses.

Extra care has to be take when using [brackets [like this], because they are special]. For example,
they could not be closed like this [.

But it's even more problematic if they are not opened: ]]

There are a number of special characters like =, +, -, and / that should be parsed as text.

Star in word context: a*b and text*3

Underscore in word context: snake_case

Star NOT in word - after space: a *b
